* Data orientedness
:PROPERTIES:
:ARCHIVE_TIME: 2025-09-27 토 10:42
:ARCHIVE_FILE: ~/notes/20220923T161021--index__public.org
:ARCHIVE_OLPATH: Glossary (work in progress)/Clojure
:ARCHIVE_CATEGORY: 20220923T161021--index__public
